sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant HTML as index.html
    participant JS_Index as js/index.js
    participant Convert as convertHSVandRGBA
    participant Processor as data-processor
    participant ChartFactory as chart-factory
    participant ChartManager as chart-manager
    participant Display as display.js
    participant TableDisplay as table-display
    participant Filter as data-filter

    User->>JS_Index: 画像をアップロード
    JS_Index->>JS_Index: handleImageUpload()
    JS_Index->>JS_Index: img.onload → extractHSV()
    
    loop ピクセルごと
        JS_Index->>Convert: rgbToHsv(r, g, b)
        Convert-->>JS_Index: HSV返却
    end
    
    JS_Index->>JS_Index: HSVデータ集計・ソート
    
    JS_Index->>Display: displayCharts(hsvData)
    Display->>Processor: processHSVFrequencyData()
    Processor-->>Display: 周波数データ返却
    
    Display->>Processor: generateHueLabelsAndData()
    Processor-->>Display: ラベル・データ返却
    
    Display->>Processor: generateSaturationLabelsAndData()
    Display->>Processor: generateValueLabelsAndData()
    
    Display->>ChartFactory: createHueChart()
    ChartFactory-->>Display: Hueチャート
    Display->>ChartManager: setHueChart()
    
    Display->>ChartFactory: createSVChart()
    Display->>ChartFactory: createSaturationChart()
    Display->>ChartFactory: createValueChart()
    
    JS_Index->>TableDisplay: displayHSVData(hsvData)
    TableDisplay->>Convert: hsvToRgb()
    Convert-->>TableDisplay: RGB返却
    TableDisplay->>HTML: テーブル描画
    
    User->>ChartFactory: Hueチャートクリック
    ChartFactory->>Filter: filterTableByHue()
    Filter->>TableDisplay: displayHSVData(フィルタ済みデータ)
    TableDisplay->>HTML: テーブル再描画